          "worked": "Let $f$ be Tiff's father's current age in years.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}f-2&=3(f-28)\\\\f-2&=3f-84\\\\-2&=2f-84\\\\82&=2f\\\\41&=f\\end{align*}$$\n\nTiff's father is 41 years old. Two years ago he was 39; 28 years ago he was 13, and $3\\times13=39$.",
